      "message": "`combined_apis` currently works similar to a singleton module, and adding dependencies to a singleton module generally harms the incremental build time. I\u0027m not fully knowledgeable about how `ctx.WalkDeps` works, but I would not be the biggest supporter of this approach if `ctx.WalkDeps` blocks the compilation of the internally generated modules of `combined_apis`.\n\nQuestion: Why is `ctx.WalkDeps` being added in `combined_apis`? Is there a reason why this can\u0027t be done in individual stub libraries level? It does not seem too intuitive to have `java_sdk_library` specific logic in `combined_apis`",
